# Cloudflare Pages response headers (ignored by GitHub Pages).
# Note: when several rules match a URL, Cloudflare MERGES their headers, so
# Cache-Control is set only on specific paths below and never on /* —
# otherwise the two values would be concatenated into nonsense.

# --- Notes for the /* block below (kept outside the block because
# Cloudflare only documents full-line comments at column 0) ---
# Interview practice uses the Web Speech API, which needs the microphone
# on our own origin; everything else is denied. payment=(self) lets
# Razorpay checkout (opened from our page) use the Payment Request API.
# REPORT-ONLY: the browser logs violations in the console but blocks
# nothing. See docs/DEPLOYMENT.md ("Turning on the Content Security
# Policy") for how to flip it to enforcing.
# 
# Why each origin is here (found in index.html, src/ and the libraries):
# script  : googletagmanager.com (gtag Ads tag, index.html), checkout.razorpay.com
# (checkout.js, index.html), us-assets.i.posthog.com (PostHog lazy-loaded
# modules). 'unsafe-inline' is needed for the inline gtag snippet in
# index.html; an enforced policy could replace it with a hash later.
# style   : fonts.googleapis.com (index.html). 'unsafe-inline' because React/Radix
# set inline style attributes.
# font    : fonts.gstatic.com.
# connect : *.supabase.co (REST/auth/functions) + wss for realtime; PostHog
# us.i.posthog.com / us-assets.i.posthog.com; Razorpay api/lumberjack;
# Google tag endpoints (google-analytics, analytics.google.com,
# googleadservices, doubleclick, google.com).
# frame   : api.razorpay.com + checkout.razorpay.com (checkout modal), Google tag
# iframes (googletagmanager, td.doubleclick.net).
# img     : Google/DoubleClick tracking pixels, Razorpay logos, data:/blob: for
# generated images.
# worker  : blob: (PostHog and bundlers spin up blob workers).

/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: microphone=(self), camera=(), geolocation=(), payment=(self), usb=(), bluetooth=(), accelerometer=(), gyroscope=(), magnetometer=(), interest-cohort=()
  Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://www.googletagmanager.com https://www.google-analytics.com https://www.googleadservices.com https://googleads.g.doubleclick.net https://checkout.razorpay.com https://us-assets.i.posthog.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' data: https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data: blob: https://www.google.com https://www.google.co.in https://www.googletagmanager.com https://www.google-analytics.com https://googleads.g.doubleclick.net https://stats.g.doubleclick.net https://www.googleadservices.com https://cdn.razorpay.com https://checkout.razorpay.com; connect-src 'self' https://*.supabase.co wss://*.supabase.co https://us.i.posthog.com https://us-assets.i.posthog.com https://api.razorpay.com https://lumberjack.razorpay.com https://checkout.razorpay.com https://www.google-analytics.com https://*.google-analytics.com https://*.analytics.google.com https://www.googletagmanager.com https://www.googleadservices.com https://googleads.g.doubleclick.net https://stats.g.doubleclick.net https://www.google.com https://www.google.co.in; frame-src https://api.razorpay.com https://checkout.razorpay.com https://www.googletagmanager.com https://td.doubleclick.net https://bid.g.doubleclick.net; worker-src 'self' blob:; media-src 'self' blob:; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self' https://api.razorpay.com; frame-ancestors 'none'

# Hashed filenames from Vite never change content, so cache for a year.
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

# The HTML shell points at the current hashed bundles, so it must always be
# revalidated or users would keep loading an old build after a deploy.
/
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/index.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache
